---
import Base from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<Base title="About" description="About Rafaela Henriques">
    <section class="section">
        <h1 class="page-title">About Me</h1>

        <p class="lead">
            I’m a web developer who enjoys building fast, focused interfaces
            with as little noise as possible. My background mixes web
            development, creative coding, and game development in Unity.
        </p>

        <p>
            I care about structure, performance, and clear communication in the
            UI. Every component should have a reason to exist—if a feature
            doesn’t help the user or the product, it doesn’t ship.
        </p>

        <p>
            I like working close to the front end: establishing design tokens,
            building responsive layouts, and wiring up interactions that feel
            smooth but never distracting.
        </p>

        <h2>What I work with</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Web</strong>: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Astro, React</li>
            <li><strong>Interaction & motion</strong>: GSAP, Framer Motion</li>
            <li><strong>Programming</strong>: C#, C++, Python, JavaScript</li>
            <li>
                <strong>Game development</strong>: Unity (input, UI, basic
                physics, game flow)
            </li>
            <li><strong>Tools</strong>: Git, GitHub, VS Code, Figma</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How I work</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Mobile-first layouts, then refine for larger breakpoints.</li>
            <li>Reusable components over copy–paste styling.</li>
            <li>Accessibility as a requirement, not an add-on.</li>
            <li>
                Prefer small, focused features over bloated “all-in-one” pages.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            <a
                href="mailto:rafaela.henriques@student.howest.be"
                class="button button--primary"
                aria-label="Email Rafaela"
            >
                Email me
            </a>
        </p>
    </section>
</Base>
